@Rey and @Paratoxian: Sticks dropping around Twiggy Trees intentionally do not stack, because otherwise they'll drop 40 Twigs underneath them over time, which is not how the game is supposed to work. They normally check how many stacks (of 1) are around them, and stop dropping more when there are 2. Therefore, the mod stops Twigs from auto-stacking and auto-pickup'ing when they are spawned near a Twiggy Tree. It's the same deal with the bird eggs near penguins. They should, however, be checking for penguins and not birdcages, so I'm not sure why it affects birdcages. I'll look into that.
